    "detailed_description": "Set in a tranquil town built upon a sealed ruin, a nostalgic adventure drama unfolds by children!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Synopsis<br />\r\nBlue is a young boy who has moved to a rural town from the city.<br />\r\nGrowing frustrated with the dull country life, he explores the outskirts of town when suddenly a stone monument opens with a mysterious power, revealing a girl named Lava.<br />\r\nWith a mysterious weapon given by the girl, Blue heads towards the ruins connected underground from the stone monument.<br />\r\nWill he be able to unlock the secrets that sleep within the ruins...?!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Level Up with Defeating Enemies!<br />\r\nAs you level up, you can select one ability out of three.<br />\r\nFind the best combination of abilities to efficiently conquer the ruins!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEstimated Playtime: About 1 hour",
